    "headline": "EMCOR (NYSE:EME) Surprises With Strong Q2 CY2026, Stock Jumps 13.8%",
    "summary": "Specialty construction contractor company EMCOR (NYSE:EME) reported revenue ahead of Wall Street’s expectations in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 19.8% year on year to $5.15 billion. The company’s full-year revenue guidance of $20.25 billion at the midpoint came in 6.6% above analysts’ estimates. Its GAAP profit of $9.06 per share was 25.9% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
